    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6">

                <pb facs="0021" n="14" xml:id="pg14"/>

                <head>No. 6.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Braida to Mr. Uhl.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Consulate</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San Juan
                                del Norte</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-02"><hi rendition="#italic">March 2, 1894</hi></date>.
                        (Received March 16.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I succeeded in procuring, just a few
                    moments before the departure of a special schooner for Bluefields, a Spanish
                    copy of Mr. H. F. Bingham’s (the British consul’s) first communication to the
                    Nicaraguan commissioner at Bluefields. I am hardly able to have it translated in
                    time, and therefore beg to excuse the form of transmission.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">S. C. Braida</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">United States Consul.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d6-a1.xml" xpointer="d6-a1"/>
            </div>
